Dear Sir,
As per our telephonic discussion regarding RC observation points, please fi=
nd below details and share the offer for the same.

Responsible care audit observations-


1.      Identify the potential sources of Ground Water contamination and in=
stitute measures to mitigate the risks

2.      Include parameters related to products and raw materials for soil t=
esting to ascertain soil contamination.

3.      Analyse ground water for assessment of contamination. The sampling =
of ground water to be done from first strata by making micro bores / piezo =
wells. Sampling points to be decided based on hydrogeological survey to obt=
ain groundwater flow direction.

4.      Required permission for this purpose may be obtained, if required, =
from concerned authorities, after explaining the purpose.


Thanks


Anand Dubey
Deputy Manager - EHS

